      "description_for_judge": "Write the requested standalone clipboard value through the iOS PiP background queue.",
      "prompt": "测试环境状态：iOS，Aiden 在后台，PiP Bridge 已开启。请把文本「PiP clipboard benchmark」写入手机系统剪贴板。",
